+    {
+      "type": "tip",
+      "content": "*Debido a* and *a raíz de* take a noun: *debido a la lluvia*. If you want a verb, change the connector: *porque llueve mucho*. *A raíz de* fits best when the cause is an event that changed things (*a raíz del terremoto*)."
     }
   ]
 }
diff --git a/content/es-latam/grammar/b2/b2-colombiaperiferias-03-a-gr.json b/content/es-latam/grammar/b2/b2-colombiaperiferias-03-a-gr.json
