+    {
+      "type": "text",
+      "title": "Where you meet it",
+      "content": "Laws, official letters and the notices of a community council use this register. When you read the Spanish of a law, look for the future (*podrán*, *deberán*), *se* (*no podrán venderse*) and the open \"anyone who\" with the subjunctive."
+    },
+    {
+      "type": "examples",
+      "title": "In context",
