+      "type": "tip",
+      "content": "Use *dijo que* when the verb in the reported part moves back in time. *Según* (B1 Unit 13) gives the source without moving the tense: *Según la ONU, entregaron casi nueve mil armas*. Either way, say who is speaking."
     }
   ]
 }
